<title>CANADA: CHC Helicopter gets North Sea contract.</title>
<headline>CHC Helicopter gets North Sea contract.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>CHC Helicopter Corp said on Thursday that its British International operating unit has been awarded a contract by Talisman Energy (UK) Ltd for helicopter services in support of the company's North Sea operations.</p>
<p>The multi-million dollar contrct -- no amount was specified -- is for a two-year period beginning January and includes an option to extend. The contract involves helicopter support services for Talisman's operations in the Beatrice, Buchan and Clyde fields.</p>
<p>((Reuters Montreal bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
</text>
